//! The event pages end to end through the router, without a network: an
//! in-memory repository with the same optimistic locking as SQL, the real
//! CSRF, flash and method-override layers, and an access policy that lets
//! every request in (the generated [`DenyAll`] default is tested last).
//! Generated by `forge generate scaffold`.

